{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>XEOM: Saigon Edition</strong> drops you into the bustling heart of Saigon, where you become a motorbike taxi driver zipping through narrow alleys, dodging traffic, picking up passengers, delivering packages, and avoiding all sorts of obstacles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a taxi rider In the heart of Sai Gon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a variety of delivery missions and earn your keep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgrades, unlock new riders and keep your bike refueled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge oncoming traffic and finesse your way around the many wacky obstacles on Sai Gon roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover iconic landmarks: Independence Palace, the glamorous Bui Vien street and Ben Thanh market</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227180?t=1757571027","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227180/a9fbffde6491d7490925df9f0d6da05c6949a300/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757571027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227180/0db897de7d465b50f04acc44fdc8a3caa72b8ed2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757571027","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227180/0db897de7d465b50f04acc44fdc8a3caa72b8ed2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757571027","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id"